    {
      "episode": 1,
      "episodeNumber": 1,
      "title": "Magic Episode 1: Magic to Say What You Are Thinking",
      "aired": "2023-10-11T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-10-11T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren, Heiter, and Eisen test the spell that causes the user to say whatever they are thinking on Himmel, who begins to wax-poetic about his looks aloud. The three of them agree that it would be unbearable to listen to it long term."
    },
    {
      "episode": 2,
      "episodeNumber": 2,
      "title": "Magic Episode 2: Magic to Just Remove Alcohol from Booze",
      "aired": "2023-10-25T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-10-25T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "After using the spell that removes just the alcohol from an alcoholic drink, Frieren, Himmel, and Eisen taste the drink and can`t tell the difference. They then urge Heiter to try the drink, but he immediately guesses that the drink isn`t alcoholic, to which the party all call him a Corrupt Priest."
    },
    {
      "episode": 3,
      "episodeNumber": 3,
      "title": "Magic Episode 3: Magic to Wake Up at the Right Time at Morning",
      "aired": "2023-11-15T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-15T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren, Heiter, and Eisen test the spell that causes the user to say whatever they are thinking on Himmel, who begins to wax-poetic about his looks aloud. The three of them agree that it would be unbearable to listen to it long term."
    },
    {
      "episode": 4,
      "episodeNumber": 4,
      "title": "Magic Episode 4: Magic to Make a Good Scent Come from the Body",
      "aired": "2023-11-29T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-11-29T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren and Fern wonder what type of good smell the spell produces. They try it on Stark, and find that he smells like grilled meat. The two conclude that the smell is based on the user`s definition of a good smell. Stark asks what`s for dinner, and both Frieren and Fern exclaim that they want meat, scaring Stark."
    },
    {
      "episode": 5,
      "episodeNumber": 5,
      "title": "Magic Special Episode: Magic to Make for a Merry Dining Table",
      "aired": "2023-12-14T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-14T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren`s Party test the spell, which produces a bottle of Ajipon. They try the sauce with meat and find that it is delicious. Stark wonders if the sauce would taste good with dragon meat, and Frieren and Fern tell him to go defeat a dragon on his own so they can see."
    },
    {
      "episode": 6,
      "episodeNumber": 6,
      "title": "Magic Episode 5: Magic to Improve Luck",
      "aired": "2023-12-27T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2023-12-27T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren`s Party test the spell on Stark, who proceeds to have exceptional luck. The path they pick has no monsters and he wins a grand prize. Seeing this, Sein asks Frieren to cast the spell on him. He then goes gambling, but later returns with no clothes. Stark wonders if the spell didn`t work, but Frieren says that Sein is just bad."
    },
    {
      "episode": 7,
      "episodeNumber": 7,
      "title": "Magic Episode 6: Magic to Remove Annoying Oil Stains",
      "aired": "2024-01-10T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2024-01-10T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Sein has the idea of using the spell for profit by charging people who need tough oil stains removed from their pots and pans. However, because they offer to clean the first pot or pan for free, everyone only brings one pot or pan, and it ends up being volunteer work for Frieren."
    },
    {
      "episode": 8,
      "episodeNumber": 8,
      "title": "Magic Episode 7: Magic to Speak Extremely Fast Without Faltering",
      "aired": "2024-01-24T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2024-01-24T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren and Heiter try the spell out on the taciturn Eisen. At first the spell doesn`t seem to have worked, but when they ask him about a recent battle, both his speech and his movements increase in speed. Frieren and Heiter conclude that it`s good for people to have their own manner of speech."
    },
    {
      "episode": 9,
      "episodeNumber": 9,
      "title": "Magic Episode 8: Magic to Understand the Feelings of a Fish",
      "aired": "2024-02-07T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2024-02-07T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren and Fern decide to test the spell on fish that Stark has caught while he gathers firewood. The fish speak pitifully and bemoan their family`s bad luck, as their father was caught the day before. They wonder if they will be roasted or simmered. Frieren and Fern lose the appetite for fish and ask Stark to release them to his shock."
    },
    {
      "episode": 10,
      "episodeNumber": 10,
      "title": "Magic Episode 9: Magic to Improve Luck (Part 2)",
      "aired": "2024-02-19T23:00:00+09:00",
      "airedDate": "2024-02-19T23:00:00+09:00",
      "thumbnail": null,
      "imageUrl": null,
      "description": "Frieren`s Party encounter three treasure chests. Fern cautions that at least one of them must be a mimic, so Stark suggests using the magic that brings good luck. The first chest contains gold and treasure, and the second chest contains a rare grimoire. To their dismay, Frieren insists on opening the third chest, which is a mimic. She gets caught and yells that it is dark and scary inside, and Fern wonders if Frieren did this on purpose."
    },
